millerx (0.7.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Computer column (the computer button): all mounted disks (also from
    /etc/fstab) with free space, removable media to mount and eject, network
    shares and GVfs places, Connect to server. Replaces the drive button.
  * Settings: thumbnails not in network folders (default) / always / never.
  * Settings in three tabs: Look, Thumbnails, Folders.
  * Installed optional helpers (ffmpeg, pdftoppm, pkexec) can be switched off.
  * Comments after values in millerx.conf are ignored.
  * NOTICE: forks welcome, the name and logo stay with the original.

